voice once, by wire, from the operating account.\n\n- **Payment:** PAY0001, status \"sent\"\n- **Invoice:** INV-97888 (due 2026-11-04)\n- **Amount:** $6,144.12, the full invoice amount\n\n**Making sure it was only paid once:** Before sending, I checked the operating account and found no earlier payments. I also attached a unique key (`pay-INV-97888-wire`) to the wire, so if the same request is sent again it won't create a second payment.\n\n**Approval:** The payment is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n\n**Invoices I didn't pay:**\n- INV-20626 ($8,376.15): still a draft waiting for approval.\n- INV-23088 ($8,596.63): already marked as paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}